### mockFn.mockImplementation(fn)

Source: https://github.com/jestjs/jest/blob/main/docs/MockFunctionAPI.md

Accepts a function to be used as the implementation for the mock function while still recording calls and instances. It can also be used to mock class constructors.

```APIDOC
## mockFn.mockImplementation(fn)

### Description
Accepts a function that should be used as the implementation of the mock. The mock will record all calls and instances while executing the provided implementation.

### Parameters
- **fn** (`Function`) - The function to use as the mock implementation.

### Syntax
```javascript
mockFn.mockImplementation(fn)
```

### Returns
- `mockFn` - The mock function instance.

### Example
```javascript
const mockFn = jest.fn();
mockFn.mockImplementation(scalar => 36 + scalar);
mockFn(2); // 38
```
```
